      "purpose": "`analysis` is a deterministic `go/analysis` policy suite for Go organizations. It enforces repository architecture, context propagation, lifecycle ownership, HTTP ownership, secure API migration, and typed secret handling, plus shared mutable state policy, without replacing the compiler, `go vet`, Staticcheck, golangci-lint, gosec, govulncheck, CodeQL, race tests, fuzzing, or NilAway.",
